OL,3,GNEWSABrewery helps to keep deer fed at
OL,4,Adrought-hit park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA brewery is helping to keep the
OL,7,Fresident deer at a park in Nottingham
OL,8,Ffed after a warm, dry summer has left
OL,9,Fthem with less to graze on.
OL,11,FWollaton Park is home to a herd of
OL,12,Fabout 200 deer which roam freely and
OL,13,Fusually forage for their own food. But
OL,14,Fa summer of extreme weather has made
OL,15,Ffinding food more difficult.
OL,17,FNottingham City Council, which owns the
OL,18,FGrade I-listed house and park, has
OL,19,Fcalled on local breweries to help by
OL,20,Fproviding their spent grain - a
OL,21,Fby-product of the brewing process - to
OL,22,Ffeed the deer.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
